than they should be

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:06.460
because we're such a small team
to make all of this happen.

00:23:06.460 --> 00:23:09.370
And my husband is taking
a huge financial risk

00:23:09.370 --> 00:23:11.900
by helping me cover the costs.

00:23:11.900 --> 00:23:15.983
And so to know that people
are trying to find my sisters,

00:23:17.260 --> 00:23:20.330
or death threats about
my husband or my sisters,

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:24.400
or God forbid, like I travel
a lot, I fly to LA often

00:23:24.400 --> 00:23:27.360
for what I'm doing with
Amanda and coordinating care,

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:30.660
which I personally
cover, the GoFundMe funds

00:23:30.660 --> 00:23:33.200
go to giving and get paid
directly to hospitals.

00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:36.100
So none of those expenses.

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:36.933
Larry and I--

00:23:36.933 --> 00:23:38.715
- [Mark] If you look at the,

00:23:38.715 --> 00:23:39.548
