00:23:52.860 --> 00:23:54.360
I mean, it's like, I want to
just turn off the comments

00:23:54.360 --> 00:23:55.193
permanently on my channel.

00:23:55.193 --> 00:23:56.870
- Well, my Instagram messages,

00:23:56.870 --> 00:24:01.870
I originally told everybody
that if they want to get a copy

00:24:02.260 --> 00:24:04.920
