00:24:11.840 --> 00:24:15.540
And so my Instagram messages
have been flooded with threats

00:24:15.540 --> 00:24:20.120
and trying to find my sisters,
trying to find my husband,

00:24:20.120 --> 00:24:22.670
and trying to share my address publicly.

00:24:22.670 --> 00:24:24.780
And so those things are really scary

00:24:24.780 --> 00:24:27.430
when you're going out of your way.

00:24:27.430 --> 00:24:29.580
I'm not the best on film.

00:24:29.580 --> 00:24:30.820
I know that there's a lot of things

00:24:30.820 --> 00:24:32.090
that I need to work on

00:24:32.090 --> 00:24:35.170
because my job is
actually behind a computer

00:24:35.170 --> 00:24:36.630
or in a treatment center.

00:24:36.630 --> 00:24:38.350
And so these are not things

00:24:38.350 --> 00:24:40.800
that I'm like prepped and poised on,

00:24:40.800 --> 00:24:43.950
but when it comes to me being on camera

00:24:43.950 --> 00:24:45.710
and putting myself out there,

00:24:45.710 --> 00:24:48.380
and then my family
getting the repercussions

00:24:48.380 --> 00:24:51.190
where I've had to take down
my team page on my website

00:24:51.190 --> 00:24:53.610
because some of my team
members were getting attacks.

00:24:53.610 --> 00:24:56.940
And so to know that so
many people are taking

00:24:56.940 --> 00:25:00.910
