00:25:07.120 --> 00:25:10.210
which is to publicly go out there

00:25:10.210 --> 00:25:12.010
and try to be a part of this.

00:25:12.010 --> 00:25:14.323
- [Mark] No, it's sad that
social media does this.

00:25:15.320 --> 00:25:17.690
It's not you 'cause I've seen it many,

00:25:17.690 --> 00:25:20.653
in many cases on my channel and it's sad.

00:25:21.519 --> 00:25:23.470
I think a lot of people are
very disturbed out there.

00:25:23.470 --> 00:25:25.950
- I will end on a very positive note

00:25:25.950 --> 00:25:29.400
because I also did receive
some of the sweetest messages

